<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Powerwave Tech started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Powerwave Tech started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- UBS Securities said it initiated coverage of Powerwave Tecnologies Inc with a buy rating.</p>
<p>-- expects Powerwave to earn $0.65 a share in 1997 and $0.85 in 1998.</p>
<p>-- set a six to nine month price target in the low $20s.</p>
<p>-- Powerwave gained 1/4 to 17-1/4 in early morning trading.</p>
<p>(( -- Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
